@startuml activity-manage-inventory
' Manage inventory: the admin sets the stock of a product variant.

title Manage inventory

|Admin|
|Coffee Shop System|

|Admin|
start
:1 · Open Manage Inventory;
|Coffee Shop System|
:Show the stock\n(per variant, low stock marked);
repeat
  |Admin|
  :2 · Pick a variant, enter the quantity, click Save;
  |Coffee Shop System|
  :Check the quantity\n(whole number, 0 or more);
backward :Show the error;
repeat while (Valid?) is ([no]) not ([yes])
:Save the new quantity;
:Show the updated stock;
stop

@enduml
